      "id": "scenA-foot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 1560,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Topology spread (maxSkew 1, hard by AZ / soft by node) keeps the 3-pod floor from stacking on one node: 2 on-demand nodes carry 2+1. 1 capacity-buffer pod sits idle on spot-burst, holding a node's worth of headroom for whatever happens next.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Topology spread (maxSkew 1, hard by AZ / soft by node) keeps the 3-pod floor from stacking on one node: 2 on-demand nodes carry 2+1. 1 capacity-buffer pod sits idle on spot-burst, holding a node's worth of headroom for whatever happens next.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "index": "bVZH",
