      "id": "scenB-foot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 917,
      "width": 1560,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "On-demand-baseline stays full and untouched throughout: spot-burst absorbs the whole event. The buffer's freed capacity is reused in seconds; the pods still waiting get scheduled once Karpenter's new node is Ready; that same node ends up hosting the refilled buffer, restoring the safety net for the next spike.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
