      "id": "scenC-foot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1371,
      "width": 1306.39697265625,
      "height": 16.25,
      "text": "Replicas, and the nodes behind them, are pre-warmed well before T0. When the sale actually starts, traffic lands on capacity that already exists: no eviction, no node still provisioning, no scramble.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
